{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"web_search","id":"exec-984625e2-5c9c-4ba6-af67-42d702ad2ca6","query":"site:platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat max_completion_tokens visible reasoning upper bound response_format schema prompt tokens ...","action":{"type":"search","queries":["site:platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat max_completion_tokens visible reasoning upper bound response_format schema prompt tokens","site:cookbook.openai.com how to count tokens with tiktoken chat completions optional functions extra tokens estimates not timeless guarantees","site:docs.typesafe.ai jev systemone input_tokens pricing tokenizer state questions usage model context","TypeSafe Jev 1.14  input tokens tokenizer systemone docs.typesafe.ai"]},"results":[{"type":"text_result","domain":"typesafe-jev.com","ref_id":"turn0search0","snippet":"POST https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone ... Two optional headers switch on newer features: `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Images: true` for images and Box questions (experimental), and `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-","title":"TypeSafe Jev API Reference: Request, Response & Errors | Jev Model Guide","url":"https://typesafe-jev.com/en/guides/api/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"icodeeasy.cc","ref_id":"turn0search1","snippet":"Integration Guides→Model guides→TypeSafe Jev / System One API Guide ... Only TypeSafe Jev 1.14 is public, with the fixed model ID `jev-1.14.0`. ... The response","title":"TypeSafe Jev / System One API | I Code Easy","url":"https://icodeeasy.cc/auth/session-migration/?return_to=%2Fen%2Fdocs%2Ftypesafe-systemone%2F"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"jevwiki.ai","ref_id":"turn0search2","snippet":"> TL;DR Jev is TypeSafe's flagship and first System One model. ... Text input in production; images (both versions), the `box` question type (1.14 only)","title":"Jev (model) — jevwiki.ai","url":"https://jevwiki.ai/wiki/entities/jev.md"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"jev.pro","ref_id":"turn0search3","snippet":"Jev (TypeSafe System One) evaluates one `state` against a map of typed `questions` and returns `answers` under the same ids. ... Canonical prose: docs.typesafe.ai/api. ...","title":"Jev API decision endpoint · jev.pro","url":"https://jev.pro/api/jev-api-decision-endpoint/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"jevwiki.ai","ref_id":"turn0search4","snippet":"`POST https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone` with `Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>` and `Content-Type: application/json`; a missing or invalid key returns `401`. ... Since the 2026-11-07 capture the mo","title":"FAQ for agents and developers — jevwiki.ai","url":"https://jevwiki.ai/wiki/syntheses/faq.md"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"ai.topxea.com","ref_id":"turn0search5","snippet":"What Jev 1.14 returns, how to call POST /v1/systemone with text or images, Box questions, the one-line setup for a TypeSafe key, and the price.","title":"Jev (TypeSafe System One) · TopxAI Docs","url":"https://ai.topxea.com/docs/jev-typesafe-system-one"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"router.com","ref_id":"turn0search6","snippet":"TypeSafe charges for input tokens; output is free (USD 0.00 per 1M tokens). ... Send the `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Long-Context: true` header to raise both the per-request and","title":"Jev 1.14 pricing and specifications | Ramp Router","url":"https://router.com/models/jev-1.14.0"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"jevwiki.ai","ref_id":"turn0search7","snippet":"> TL;DR `POST https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone` with `Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>`, `Content-Type: application/json`, and a body of `{state, model, questions}`. ... Raises the per-request and ","title":"HTTP API: POST /v1/systemone and GET /v1/models — jevwiki.ai","url":"https://jevwiki.ai/wiki/reference/http-api.md"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"fastrouter.ai","ref_id":"turn0search8","snippet":"Jev 1.14 is the newest release of TypeSafe's flagship System One model, served by POST /v1/systemone. ... Charged per input token, output tokens are free.","title":"Jev 1.14 API Pricing & Providers | FastRouter.ai","url":"https://fastrouter.ai/models/typesafe/jev-1.14.0"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"systemonemodels.org","ref_id":"turn0search9","snippet":"The endpoint is POST https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone, authenticated with a bearer token. ... `curl https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone \\ ... \"usage\": { \"input_tokens\": 312, \"output_tokens\": 48 }","title":"How to get Jev API access | System One Models","url":"https://systemonemodels.org/guides/how-to-get-jev-access/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"jevlaya.cc","ref_id":"turn0search10","snippet":"Jev is TypeSafe’s flagship model and the first System One model. ... * Price: Charged per input token. ... Contact sales@typesafe.ai.","title":"Models - jevlaya","url":"https://jevlaya.cc/en/jev/models"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"skeletonkey.run","ref_id":"turn0search11","snippet":"Jev 1.14 (jev-1.14.0) | $42 / $0.042 | per Btok / per Mtok (input tokens; output free) | Available from October 14, 2026; jev-latest and","title":"TypeSafe API — SkeletonKey API index","url":"https://skeletonkey.run/apis/typesafe/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"centos.hi.no","ref_id":"turn0search12","snippet":"The input type that the model reads: `\"text\"`, `\"image\"` or `\"text+image\"`. ... Makes a decider for a Jev model on the TypeSafe API (`https://api.typesafe.ai`, SystemOne","title":"decisions: Typed Decisions from Decision Models","url":"https://centos.hi.no/cran/web/packages/decisions/decisions.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"cran.rstudio.com","ref_id":"turn0search13","snippet":"OpenRouter documents no image field for decisions, so the table of input types gives every OpenRouter model the input type `\"text\"`. ... Other deciders: `decider_foundry()`,","title":"decisions: Typed Decisions from Decision Models","url":"https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/decisions/decisions.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"cran.uni-muenster.de","ref_id":"turn0search14","snippet":"*Jev and System One compatible servers* ... The default server is TypeSafe AI’s hosted Jev, read with the key in `TYPESAFE_API_KEY`.","title":"tidyllm: Tidy Integration of Large Language Models","url":"https://cran.uni-muenster.de/web/packages/tidyllm/tidyllm.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"accelresearching.com","ref_id":"turn0search15","snippet":"GLiNER2.5 is the only encoder-style system in the set, which makes it an architectural contrast rather than a like-for-like comparison with the others. ... |","title":"JevBreak: Your Model, Their Decision","url":"https://accelresearching.com/accel-zinc-picolinate-50mg/?_=%2Fpdf%2F2611.03759%23nLw79nwZb1b3uPkZUsgpm5M%3D"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search16","snippet":"\"TypeSafe AI Releases Jev 1.14 With Images, Box Type and 262k Context\". ... * \"Introducing System One Models & Jev - TypeSafe AI Blog\". typesafe.ai.","title":"Jev (AI model)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jev_%28AI_model%29"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"fr.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search17","snippet":"* (en) Diogo Almeida, « Introducing System One Models & Jev », sur typesafe.ai, TypeSafe AI, 15 septembre 2026 (consulté le 24 septembre 2026) ...","title":"Jev","url":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jev"}]}}
