rates.","title":"Decisions | OpenAI API","url":"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/decisions"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"developers.openai.com","ref_id":"turn4search10","snippet":"Returns input token counts of the request. Returns an object with `object` set to `response.input_tokens` and an `input_tokens` count. ... Marks the exact end of","title":"Get input token counts | OpenAI API Reference","url":"https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/responses/subresources/input_tokens/methods/count"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"developers.openai.com","ref_id":"turn4search11","snippet":"For example, when making an API request to Chat Completions with the o1 model, the following token counts will apply toward the context window total:","title":"Conversation state | OpenAI API","url":"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/conversation-state?api-mode=responses"}]}}
